      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The outside-view base rate is the mean of eight consecutive preliminary prints from 2024-Q3 through 2026-Q2: 14.9/8 = 1.8625%. Their range is -0.8% to 4.9%. A persistence component pulls toward the latest 1.4% print before considering current-quarter evidence."
      },
